monaco.jsdoc.bcryptGenSaltSyncDoc.tr:
Senkron olarak bcrypt salt üretir.

Örnek:
```javascript
const salt = bcrypt.genSaltSync(12);
const hash = bcrypt.hashSync("pass", salt);
```

monaco.jsdoc.bcryptGenSaltSyncDoc.en:
Synchronously generates a bcrypt salt.

Example:
```javascript
const salt = bcrypt.genSaltSync(12);
const hash = bcrypt.hashSync("pass", salt);
```

monaco.jsdoc.dbBeginDoc.tr:
Veritabanı transaction (işlem) başlatır. Hata durumunda otomatik rollback yapar.

Örnek:
```javascript
await db.begin(async sql => {
  await sql`INSERT INTO ...`;
});
```

monaco.jsdoc.dbBeginDoc.en:
Starts a database transaction. Automatically rolls back on error.

Example:
```javascript
await db.begin(async sql => {
  await sql`INSERT INTO ...`;
});
```

monaco.jsdoc.sendEmailDoc.tr:
